#: ../../source/module/lora1262.rst:2 ../../source/refs/module.lora1262.ref
msgid "LoRa-1262 Module"
msgstr "LoRa-1262 模块"

#: ../../source/module/lora1262.rst:8
msgid ""
"``LoRa1262Module`` provides LoRa communication through the Module13.2 "
"LoRa-1262 radio. The radio uses the module M-Bus SPI bus and an M5IOE1 "
"controller on I2C for reset, antenna-switch, and power control."
msgstr ""
"``LoRa1262Module`` 提供 Module13.2 LoRa-1262 无线电通信功能。该无线电模块使用模块的 M-Bus SPI "
"总线，并通过 I2C 上的 M5IOE1 控制器实现复位、天线开关和电源控制。"

#: ../../source/module/lora1262.rst:12
msgid "Support the following product:"
msgstr "支持以下产品："

#: ../../source/module/lora1262.rst:14
msgid "|LoRa-1262 Module|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/lora1262.rst:16
msgid ""
"The constructor accepts an initialized ``machine.I2C`` bus. When ``i2c`` "
"is omitted, the module uses ``module.mbus.i2c1``. The M5IOE1 address must"
" be in the range ``0x71`` through ``0x74``."
msgstr ""
"构造函数接受已初始化的 ``machine.I2C`` 总线。省略 ``i2c`` 时，模块使用 "
"``module.mbus.i2c1``。M5IOE1 地址必须在 ``0x71`` 到 ``0x74`` 范围内。"

#: ../../source/module/lora1262.rst:22
msgid ""
"Attach a suitable antenna before transmitting. The supported RF frequency"
" range is 850000--930000 kHz."
msgstr "发射前请连接合适的天线。支持的 RF 频率范围为 850000--930000 kHz。"

