#: module.lora1262.LoRa1262Module:1 of
msgid "Create a Module13.2 LoRa-1262 object."
msgstr "创建 Module13.2 LoRa-1262 对象。"

#: module.lora1262.LoRa1262Module:3 of
msgid ""
"The module uses the M-Bus SPI bus and a caller-supplied I2C bus. M5IOE1 "
"controls SX1262 reset on G2, antenna-switch enable on G3, and LoRa power "
"on G5."
msgstr ""
"模块使用 M-Bus SPI 总线和调用方提供的 I2C 总线。M5IOE1 控制器通过 G2 控制 SX1262 复位，通过 G3 "
"控制天线开关，并通过 G5 控制 LoRa 电源。"

